Direct-Debiting-Failure-Handling   428    8.15      Enumerated     M      P     -       V       Yes
Exponent                           429    8.9       Integer32      M      P     -       V       Yes
Final-Unit-Action                  449    8.35      Enumerated     M      P     -       V       Yes
