G-S-U-Pool-Reference               457    8.30      Grouped        M      P     -       V       Yes
Multiple-Services-Credit-Control   456    8.16      Grouped        M      P     -       V       Yes
Multiple-Services-Indicator        455    8.40      Enumerated     M      P     -       V       Yes
Rating-Group                       432    8.29      Unsigned32     M      P     -       V       Yes
Redirect-Address-Type              433    8.38      Enumerated     M      P     -       V       Yes
Redirect-Server                    434    8.37      Grouped        M      P     -       V       Yes
Redirect-Server-Address            435    8.39      UTF8String     M      P     -       V       Yes
Requested-Action                   436    8.41      Enumerated     M      P     -       V       Yes
Requested-Service-Unit             437    8.18      Grouped        M      P     -       V       Yes
Restriction-Filter-Rule            438    8.36      IPFilterRule   M      P     -       V       Yes
